<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>VEXX · Catálogo de Suplementos</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--morado:#5C16C5;--morado-prof:#772CE8;--lila:#9147FF;--crema:#F7F7F8;--carbon:#1A1626;--ink:#1A1626;--muted:#6b6577}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:var(--crema);color:var(--ink);font-family:'Montserrat',system-ui,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
img{display:block;max-width:100%}
.hero{position:relative;background:var(--carbon);color:var(--crema);overflow:hidden;padding:56px 24px 72px}
.hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 80% -10%,rgba(145,71,255,.35),transparent 55%),radial-gradient(90% 80% at 0% 110%,rgba(92,22,197,.45),transparent 60%);pointer-events:none}
.hero-inner{position:relative;max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:44px}
.brand img{height:74px;width:auto;cursor:pointer}
.eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--lila);margin-bottom:18px}
.hero h1{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(56px,11vw,128px);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:.01em}
.hero h1 .accent{color:var(--lila)}
.hero p.lead{margin-top:22px;max-width:520px;font-size:clamp(15px,2.3vw,18px);line-height:1.6;color:rgba(247,247,248,.82)}
.hero-stats{display:flex;gap:40px;margin-top:42px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.stat .n{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:46px;line-height:1;color:var(--crema)}
.stat .l{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:rgba(247,247,248,.7);margin-top:4px}
.hero-note{margin-top:40px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:rgba(247,247,248,.9);background:rgba(247,247,248,.08);border:1px solid rgba(247,247,248,.16);padding:10px 16px;border-radius:999px}
.toolbar{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 24px 8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px}
.toolbar h2{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:38px;letter-spacing:.02em}
.filters{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.fbtn{font-family:'Montserrat';font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--morado);background:transparent;border:1.5px solid rgba(92,22,197,.3);padding:9px 16px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;transition:.18s}
.fbtn:hover{border-color:var(--morado)}
.fbtn.active{background:var(--morado);color:var(--crema);border-color:var(--morado)}
.grid{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 24px 40px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:22px}
.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #ececef;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;transition:.22s ease;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(26,22,38,.04);position:relative}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 16px 40px rgba(92,22,197,.14);border-color:rgba(145,71,255,.35)}
.ph-media{aspect-ratio:1/1;background:var(--crema);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;position:relative}
.ph-media img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.ph-placeholder{flex-direction:column;gap:14px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#f4f1fb,#efeaf9)}
.ph-placeholder img.iso{width:90px;height:auto;opacity:.25;filter:invert(21%) sepia(85%) saturate(4654%) hue-rotate(263deg) brightness(78%) contrast(110%)}
.ph-soon{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:rgba(92,22,197,.4)}
.agotado-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(26,22,38,.55);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
.agotado-overlay span{font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:30px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#fff;border:2px solid #fff;padding:8px 22px;border-radius:10px;transform:rotate(-8deg)}
.card-body{padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1}
.pill{align-self:flex-start;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:12px}
.c-prot{background:rgba(92,22,197,.1);color:var(--morado)}
.c-crea{background:rgba(145,71,255,.14);color:var(--morado-prof)}
.c-pwo{background:var(--carbon);color:#fff}
.card-name{font-size:17px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25}
.card-meta{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--morado);font-weight:600;margin-top:6px}
.card-desc{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px;flex:1}
.stock-note{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:#c2410c;margin-top:8px}
.price-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:16px}
.price-block{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.price-old{font-size:14px;color:#b3aebd;text-decoration:line-through}
.price-new{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:34px;line-height:.9;color:var(--morado)}
.save-tag{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#fff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--morado),var(--lila));padding:5px 11px;border-radius:8px}
.card-cta{margin-top:16px;display:block;text-align:center;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:var(--morado);padding:12px;border-radius:11px;text-decoration:none;transition:.18s}
.card-cta:hover{background:var(--carbon)}
.card-cta.off{background:#cfccd6;pointer-events:none}
.foot{background:var(--carbon);color:var(--crema);margin-top:20px;padding:54px 24px 60px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.foot::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(80% 120% at 100% 0%,rgba(145,71,255,.28),transparent 55%);pointer-events:none}
.foot-inner{position:relative;max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:30px}
.foot h3{font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(32px,6vw,56px);line-height:.95;max-width:480px}
.foot h3 .ac{color:var(--lila)}
.foot .cities{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:rgba(247,247,248,.7);margin-top:14px}
.foot-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:var(--carbon);background:var(--crema);padding:15px 26px;border-radius:13px;text-decoration:none;transition:.18s}
.foot-cta:hover{background:var(--lila);color:#fff}
.plane{width:18px;height:18px}
.sig{position:relative;max-width:1080px;margin:40px auto 0;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid rgba(247,247,248,.14);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:12px;color:rgba(247,247,248,.55);flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}
.sig img{height:30px;width:auto;opacity:.85;cursor:pointer}

/* ===== ADMIN ===== */
#adminBar{display:none;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:var(--morado);color:#fff;padding:10px 20px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-align:center}
#adminBar b{font-family:'Bebas Neue';letter-spacing:.1em;font-size:16px;margin-right:8px}
#adminBar button{margin-left:10px;font-family:'Montserrat';font-weight:700;font-size:12.5px;border:none;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px;cursor:pointer}
#btnDescargar{background:#fff;color:var(--morado)}
#btnSalir{background:rgba(0,0,0,.25);color:#fff}
.admin-tools{display:none;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:0 20px 16px;background:#f1edf9;border-bottom:1px solid #e2dcf2;margin:0;justify-content:center;padding-top:14px}
body.admin .admin-tools{display:flex}
.atool{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;border:1.5px solid var(--morado);color:var(--morado);background:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 13px;cursor:pointer}
.card .edit-btn{display:none;position:absolute;top:10px;right:10px;z-index:5;background:var(--morado);color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:9px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer;font-family:'Montserrat'}
body.admin .card .edit-btn{display:block}
#editModal{display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(26,22,38,.6);align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:18px}
#editModal.open{display:flex}
.modal-box{background:#fff;border-radius:18px;max-width:480px;width:100%;max-height:92vh;overflow:auto;padding:26px}
.modal-box h3{font-family:'Bebas Neue';font-size:28px;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--morado);margin-bottom:16px}
.modal-box label{display:block;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin:13px 0 5px}
.modal-box input,.modal-box select{width:100%;font-family:'Montserrat';font-size:14px;padding:10px 12px;border:1.5px solid #ddd8e8;border-radius:9px}
.modal-box input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--lila)}
.row2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}
.preview-final{margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--morado)}
.img-prev{margin-top:8px;width:90px;height:90px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #eee}
.modal-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:22px}
.modal-actions button{flex:1;font-family:'Montserrat';font-weight:700;font-size:14px;padding:12px;border-radius:11px;border:none;cursor:pointer}
#mGuardar{background:var(--morado);color:#fff}
#mCancelar{background:#eee9f6;color:var(--morado)}
#mEliminar{background:#fde8e8;color:#b91c1c;flex:0 0 auto;padding:12px 16px}
@media(max-width:560px){
 .hero{padding:40px 20px 56px}
 .brand img{height:56px}
 .grid{padding:18px 16px 36px;gap:16px;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(160px,1fr))}
 .card-body{padding:15px}
 .toolbar{padding:30px 20px 4px}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="adminBar"><b>MODO ADMIN</b> Edita productos y descarga el archivo nuevo para subirlo a tu página.
  <button id="btnDescargar">⬇ Descargar HTML actualizado</button>
  <button id="btnAgregar2">+ Producto</button>
  <button id="btnSalir">Salir</button>
</div>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="brand"><img id="logoTop" src="data:image/png;base64," alt="VEXX"></div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Catálogo · Suplementación deportiva</p>
    <h1>LO QUE<br>FUNCIONA.<br><span class="accent">NADA MÁS.</span></h1>
    <p class="lead">Suplementos originales con asesoría real y entrega directa en tu ciudad. Te decimos qué estás comprando, por qué te conviene y cuánto cuesta de verdad.</p>
